nder 400 MPa without post-annealing. 37  Despite these advances, achieving highly dense CaTiO 3  microwave ceramics via CSP without post-annealing treatment remains a significant challenge. Therefore, consolidating CaTiO 3  ceramics with a Li 2 MoO 4  composite is a promising strategy for enhancing microwave dielectric properties.

